# ordin-dictation, Transcription Service: meeting files to text, on this computer only
error-trx-audio-undecodable = Ordin couldn't play the sound in that file.
error-trx-busy = Ordin is already working on another recording. It will start this one after.
error-trx-cancelled = Stopped.
error-trx-engine-failed = Ordin couldn't turn the recording into text. Try again.
error-trx-file-too-large = That file is too long. Ordin makes minutes of meetings up to four hours.
error-trx-file-unreadable = Ordin couldn't open that file. Check it is still there and try again.
error-trx-format-unsupported = Ordin can make minutes from .vtt, .docx and .txt transcripts and from .m4a, .mp3 and .wav recordings.
error-trx-model-checksum = The speech model arrived damaged and was removed. Try again.
error-trx-model-download-failed = The speech model didn't download. Check your connection and try again.
error-trx-model-missing = Ordin needs to download its speech model first.
error-trx-no-space = There isn't enough free space for the speech model. Free some space, then try again.
error-trx-transcript-empty = Ordin found no speech in that file.
error-trx-transcript-malformed = Ordin couldn't read the transcript in that file.
